astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nIKnSwSt-cYQ7kNvwHFyu6R&_nc_oc=AdkLXSNdssYZDKbWtNw6v8_F0wo2GzBjvZbwss6KMbzsIzJhFY5byq6LhyZwgcm-YoY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftv-JyZpfLMCQSAhItHfafixVSfCkgDCd1A2PWjxkNDYQ&oe=69A026F3"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZwkiR1atD2wQ7kNvwHN6gmi&_nc_oc=Adn2V9Gd9lVW9zD1X4saydyV_dOtk-VqYtKmV4NtIbwhLKbXW1HVju_BzIEn2UE0gTU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsRHKOGjZYRdzRMJRs0rIEAL6u0oHGgYLTjfX1SUWoc4w&oe=69A02796"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ISBZEWs_i48Q7kNvwELG4aB&_nc_oc=AdnVIJqtJ9PnzvGLjdOGo5e064SM4kUYOfJtMn37k20cazd4yx_CkLrbVyC6Nr0-LY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftzPJc0Y3eDoGi-mzvAt_sz5QgdR3oRKUHYYDrJU1AzyA&oe=69A0463D"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip